<title>CHILE: Chilean producer inflation at 0.4 percent in May.</title>
<headline>Chilean producer inflation at 0.4 percent in May.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wholesale prices rose 0.4 percent in May in Chile, bringing the increase to 0.5 percent in the first five months of the year and 0.7 percent in the past 12 months, the National Statistics Institute reported.</p>
<p>Wholesale prices on domestically-produced items rose 0.4 percent in May and 0.7 percent on imported items, the institute said.</p>
<p>((--Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211))</p>
